# cors-audit Rule

When auditing CORS:
1. Follow `.agents/skills/cors-audit/references/cors_checklist.md` (CORS-001 to CORS-015, CORS-B-*, CORS-I-*). Concepts: `references/cors_concepts.md`. PoCs: `references/cors_poc_templates.md`.
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/cors-audit/SKILL.md`. Track progress with `references/cors_tracker.md`.
3. Run `scripts/scope_check.sh TARGET` first, then `.agents/skills/cors-audit/scripts/cors_probe.py` with your own session.
4. Reflection is a lead; a finding is your own data read cross-origin in a real browser. Never read other users' data.
